  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja situationen f&#xf6;r utsattbarn i Ukraina. Samarbetet mellan svensk part InDevelop och Ukrainsk part Familjeministeriet skall bl.a. utveckla indikatorer och ett  monitoring system inom barnomsorg.  Totalt 3 &#xe5;r from november 2007.  Upphandling har skett.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity aims to improve the situation for children vulnerable children in Ukraine. The cooperation between Swedish partner InDevelop and Ministry of Family, Youth and Sports should among others develop indicators and a monitoring sytem within childcare. Total of 3 years starting November 2007.  A tender has been carried out.</narrative>
